[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: ReqAML — Contracts & Releases
UID: reqaml-contracts-releases
COMMENT: >>>
client: Raby-Family (raby-family)
project: ReqAML (reqaml)
Junction entities exported as REQUIREMENTs with COMMENT UID lists
Contracts/releases are not tree parents in ReqAML
<<<

[SECTION]
UID: SEC-CONTRACTS-EXPORT
TITLE: Contracts

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CONTRACT-contract-design-2026-10
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Contract Design-2026-10
STATEMENT: >>>
ReqAML contract overlay `Design-2026-10` (status=active, starts_on=2026-10-06). Links requirement versions via in_scope_of; not a tree parent.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: contract
contract_id: contract-design-2026-10
client_id: raby-family
project_id: reqaml
in_scope_of:
  - A01
  - A02
  - A03
  - A04
  - A05
  - A06
  - A07
  - A08
  - ARCH-CP-HIER
  - ARCH-VER
  - ARCH-CONTRACT
  - ARCH-RELEASE
  - ARCH-UI
  - ARCH-API
  - ARCH-OTEL
  - CTL-AC-3
  - MC01
  - MC02
<<<

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
UID: SEC-RELEASES-EXPORT
TITLE: Releases

[REQUIREMENT]
